    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Terminal Shift</strong> is a psychological horror game that takes place in a desolate airport terminal, which has been twisted\u00a0into a terrifying, looping nightmare. Escape by analyzing hidden numbers and surviving encounters with a deadly entity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/a67106afada991c6dd728ce7e7a434c5.poster.avif?t=1755748445\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/a67106afada991c6dd728ce7e7a434c5.webm?t=1755748445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/a67106afada991c6dd728ce7e7a434c5.mp4?t=1755748445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each loop contains a hidden number for the full access code. The code is procedurally generated and changes with each loop, storing your input along the way. The number can be anywhere on the surface of the airport or can be hidden as formed objects and even in patterns, such as flickering lights, sounds and movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/cf217f4429f0b61bea8c8947c354dfba.poster.avif?t=1755748445\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/cf217f4429f0b61bea8c8947c354dfba.webm?t=1755748445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/cf217f4429f0b61bea8c8947c354dfba.mp4?t=1755748445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the number is found it can be submitted into the keypad device. Collect the full 10-digit code, gain access to the boarding gates and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/7db127bdc7ad0dd2af2b239354394fa4.poster.avif?t=1755748445\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/7db127bdc7ad0dd2af2b239354394fa4.webm?t=1755748445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/7db127bdc7ad0dd2af2b239354394fa4.mp4?t=1755748445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone! Be aware of the\u00a0unknown entity that lurks around the airport, hunting you with its terrifying presence. Must be avoided at all costs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/76a0e1c0c1b86fc8a8b700f6a88ddd50.poster.avif?t=1755748445\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/76a0e1c0c1b86fc8a8b700f6a88ddd50.webm?t=1755748445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/76a0e1c0c1b86fc8a8b700f6a88ddd50.mp4?t=1755748445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive and realistic experience with minimal user interface and chilling atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an endless airport terminal and survive encounters with a deadly entity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Analyze and submit hidden numbers, throughout the loops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic player movement system with camera features.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Terminal Shift</strong> is a psychological horror game that takes place in a desolate airport terminal, which has been twisted\u00a0into a terrifying, looping nightmare. Escape by analyzing hidden numbers and surviving encounters with a deadly entity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/a67106afada991c6dd728ce7e7a434c5.poster.avif?t=1755748445\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/a67106afada991c6dd728ce7e7a434c5.webm?t=1755748445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/a67106afada991c6dd728ce7e7a434c5.mp4?t=1755748445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each loop contains a hidden number for the full access code. The code is procedurally generated and changes with each loop, storing your input along the way. The number can be anywhere on the surface of the airport or can be hidden as formed objects and even in patterns, such as flickering lights, sounds and movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/cf217f4429f0b61bea8c8947c354dfba.poster.avif?t=1755748445\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/cf217f4429f0b61bea8c8947c354dfba.webm?t=1755748445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/cf217f4429f0b61bea8c8947c354dfba.mp4?t=1755748445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the number is found it can be submitted into the keypad device. Collect the full 10-digit code, gain access to the boarding gates and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/7db127bdc7ad0dd2af2b239354394fa4.poster.avif?t=1755748445\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/7db127bdc7ad0dd2af2b239354394fa4.webm?t=1755748445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/7db127bdc7ad0dd2af2b239354394fa4.mp4?t=1755748445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone! Be aware of the\u00a0unknown entity that lurks around the airport, hunting you with its terrifying presence. Must be avoided at all costs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/76a0e1c0c1b86fc8a8b700f6a88ddd50.poster.avif?t=1755748445\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/76a0e1c0c1b86fc8a8b700f6a88ddd50.webm?t=1755748445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/76a0e1c0c1b86fc8a8b700f6a88ddd50.mp4?t=1755748445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive and realistic experience with minimal user interface and chilling atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an endless airport terminal and survive encounters with a deadly entity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Analyze and submit hidden numbers, throughout the loops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic player movement system with camera features.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support.</p></li></ul>",
